    et2_titre: "The believer's identity in Christ", et2_desc: "Who are you really in Jesus Christ? This study explores your spiritual identity.",
    et2_intro: "Introduction: Many believers live below who they truly are in Christ because they don't know their biblical identity.",
    et2_pt1: "Key point 1: You are a child of God (John 1:12). This isn't a metaphor — it's a spiritual reality. God is your Father, you belong to His family.",
