    p1_titre: "Prayer for inner peace",
    p1_texte: "Lord Jesus, my heart is troubled today. I come to You with everything I carry. You said You would give us a peace that surpasses all understanding — I claim it by faith. May Your Holy Spirit calm the storms of my soul. In Jesus' name, Amen.",
    p2_titre: "Prayer for healing",
    p2_texte: "Heavenly Father, You are the God who heals. Your Word says that by the wounds of Jesus we have been healed. I believe in Your healing power. May Your healing hand touch my body and restore my health. I thank You in advance. In Jesus' name, Amen.",
    p3_titre: "Prayer for the family",
    p3_texte: "Lord, I place my family in Your hands today. Protect every member, guide their steps, guard their hearts. Where there is conflict, bring reconciliation. May our home be a place where Your presence is tangible. In Jesus' name, Amen.",
    p4_titre: "Prayer for work and finances",
